  "description": "No Way Out is the debut studio album by American rapper Sean Combs, under the stage name Puff Daddy. It was released on July 22, 1997, through Arista Records and Combs' own Bad Boy Records. The album is credited to \"Puff Daddy & the Family\", with \"the Family\" referring to guest appearances from his signees at Bad Boy, including its then-recently deceased flagship artist, the Notorious B.I.G.",
